875
00:35:21,400 --> 00:35:49,400
[EN*]  So, everyone will ask me, is that a life-sister, a life-sister, is another form of a mental health? That answer is not true. It is not true. It can be a good relationship. A life-sister will ask me what to do with my health and health. But a life-sister will ask me what to do with my health and health. But a life-sister will ask me what to do with my health and health. I will ask you what to do with my health and health. I will ask you what to do with my health and health. I will ask you what to do with my health and health.

876
00:35:37,660 --> 00:35:43,280
[ZH] 心理治療師會問說是什麼阻礙我的當事人發揮健康的日常功能

