00:35:54,160 --> 00:35:58,780
[ZH] 但是生活陪跑師是專注於建立適應生活的功能還有能力

881
00:35:58,780 --> 00:36:03,160
[ZH] 治療師會著重在減少這個失能障礙dysfunction

882
00:36:14,820 --> 00:36:16,060
[EN*]  Now, let me give you an example.

883
00:36:17,020 --> 00:36:21,120
[EN*]  Imagine a 17-year-old suffers from severe panic attacks.

884
00:36:22,240 --> 00:36:25,700
[EN*]  That teenager needs therapy, possibly medication.

885
00:36:26,980 --> 00:36:28,560
[EN*]  Now, imagine another 17-year-old.

886
00:36:28,680 --> 00:36:31,700
[EN*]  No diagnosis, no trauma, no depression.

887
00:36:32,540 --> 00:36:34,960
[EN]  He simply has part-time management skills.

888
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:39,320
