889
00:36:40,720 --> 00:36:43,080
[EN]  Has never learned how to solve interpersonal conflict.

890
00:36:44,480 --> 00:37:03,960
[EN]  Now therapy may not be the answer. Life skills coaching probably is. One young person needs healing, the other needs development. Sometimes the same person needs both, and this is why collaboration between therapists and life skills coaches is becoming increasingly more valuable.

891
00:37:00,320 --> 00:37:04,320
[ZH] 和生活教育教導師,可以更加值得更加值得。

