899
00:38:21,980 --> 00:38:33,980
[ZH] 我都會強調這些技能,那不是要去標籤化他們的人格,而是專注在這些技能的發展,因為技能是可以被學習還有練習的,那以下就是這八大技能。

900
00:38:34,480 --> 00:38:40,480
[EN*]  Emotional regulation, learning to experience emotions without being controlled by them.

901
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:55,480
[EN*]  Executive functioning, planning, organization, time management, following through.

902
00:39:03,480 --> 00:39:10,160
[EN*]  Communication, listening, speaking honestly, having difficult conversations.

903
00:39:18,360 --> 00:39:25,840
[EN*]  Conflict resolution, disagreeing respectfully, repairing relationships, negotiating solutions.

904
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:57,480
[EN*]  Resilience, recover from setbacks, persisting through difficulty, learning that failure is information not identity.

905
00:39:57,480 --> 00:40:19,480
[EN*]  healthy relationships, boundaries, empathy, trust, respect, purpose and goal setting, living intentionally, making decisions based on values instead of emotions.

906
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:39,140
[EN*]  Personal responsibility. Taking ownership. Keeping commitments. Learning that freedom always comes with responsibility.

907
00:40:40,380 --> 00:40:50,940
[EN*]  Notice something. None of these are psychiatric treatments. They're life competencies. Yet they drastically and dramatically improve mental health.

908
00:40:57,480 --> 00:41:01,480
[EN*]  and you can understand the rights of the human being and the human being.

